WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.020 --> 00:00:02.301
Hello! [s@Hello!

2
00:00:03.162 --> 00:00:04.043
Who are you?

3
00:00:04.183 --> 00:00:06.564
I'm a bottlenose dolphin.

4
00:00:06.584 --> 00:00:13.070
Dolphins are mammals.

5
00:00:28.612 --> 00:00:30.853
We're also very smart.

6
00:00:33.674 --> 00:00:34.735
Where do you live?

7
00:00:36.255 --> 00:00:38.036
We live all over the world.

8
00:00:40.117 --> 00:00:42.098
We like tropical oceans.

9
00:00:44.699 --> 00:00:46.680
Can you breathe underwater?

10
00:00:46.700 --> 00:00:51.342
No. We come up often for air.

11
00:00:53.363 --> 00:00:55.504
We breathe through our blowholes.

12
00:00:58.708 --> 00:00:59.769
What do you eat?

13
00:01:01.651 --> 00:01:03.612
We eat lots of fish.

14
00:01:05.014 --> 00:01:07.616
We also like squid and crabs.

15
00:01:10.338 --> 00:01:11.539
Do you live alone?

16
00:01:13.641 --> 00:01:17.564
No. Bottlenose dolphins live in big groups.

17
00:01:19.186 --> 00:01:23.629
These groups are called pods.

18
00:01:23.649 --> 00:01:26.112
Wow! You can jump out of the water!

19
00:01:27.568 --> 00:01:29.970
Dolphins can jump very high.

20
00:01:31.492 --> 00:01:35.395
And then Splash!

21
00:01:40.960 --> 00:01:42.681
Do you have any enemies?

22
00:01:44.203 --> 00:01:46.765
Large sharks sometimes attack us.

23
00:01:48.386 --> 00:01:49.888
So do killer whales.

24
00:01:51.669 --> 00:01:54.332
We can get caught in fishing nets too.

25
00:01:58.744 --> 00:01:59.826
I see my pod.

26
00:02:01.428 --> 00:02:06.175
Good-bye! Bye, Bottlenose Dolphin!
